00:56:27,230 --> 00:56:28,390
गोस्वामी श्रीश्याम मनोहरजी: अनुभूति हो रही है

562
00:56:30,350 --> 00:56:35,550
गोस्वामी श्रीश्याम मनोहरजी: and you can realize Brahma Brahman in your own consciousness

563
00:56:36,750 --> 00:56:46,650
गोस्वामी श्रीश्याम मनोहरजी: Though you cannot realize or feel the other's consciousness. But you can assume that other is also Brahman. As you are Brahman.

